(dof6-actuator-saturation)
*title Native rigid-body actuator saturation recovery case
*mode rigid-body-6dof
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=7.2921151467e-5 gm=3.986004418e14
*runtime status vehicle reference-area=5.0 reference-length=1.0 inertia-x=10000.0 inertia-y=10000.0 inertia-z=10000.0 dry-mass-kg=12000.0
*runtime status target latitude-deg=34.70 longitude-deg=-119.60 altitude-m=0.0 velocity-east-mps=0.0 velocity-north-mps=0.0
*runtime status route mode=great-circle terminal-guidance-mode=propnav propnav-attitude-horizon-s=1.0 start-latitude-deg=34.70 start-longitude-deg=-120.60 duration-s=60.0 powered-end-s=10.0 terminal-start-s=20.0 apogee-altitude-m=5000.0 powered-speed-mps=1200.0 glide-speed-mps=1000.0 terminal-speed-mps=500.0 terminal-command-speed-mps=500.0
*runtime status guidance propnav-gain=2.0 attitude-gain=50000.0 rate-damping=5000.0
*runtime status actuator maximum-moment=1.0 maximum-body-rate-deg-s=30.0
*runtime status thermal policy=none

*trajectory 1 interceptor start on 1
  *initial ecic
    x=-2673469.6 y=-4520590.2 z=3636635.6
    xdt=-3086.3 ydt=747.0 zdt=-266.8
    qw=1.0 qx=0.0 qy=0.0 qz=0.0
    wx=0.0 wy=0.0 wz=0.0
    time=0.0 mass=12000.0 propellant_mass=0.0
  *segment 1 saturation
    *integ dtprnt=1.0 dt=0.05
    *aero cx=(cx) cy=(cy) cz=(cz) cmx=(cmx) cmy=(cmy) cmz=(cmz)
    *fly propnav=2
    *when time>60 stop
*end
